<section class="scoreboard-intro">
    <div class="scoreboard-intro-text">
        <h2>Thank you to all our competitors!</h2>
        <p>Whether you finished with 50 points or 35,000, thank you for spending twelve hours of your Saturday with us. Every flag on this board took someone willing to try something new, hard, or a little strange, and that's exactly what CDCTF is about.</p>
        <p>This year, 82 teams from more than 45 schools across 15+ countries put points on the board, from Tuscaloosa to Halmstad to Ho Chi Minh City. The race at the top came down to the final hours, with purple defenk, USC TACTICS Team 1, and προχωρούμε finishing within 900 points of each other. Congratulations to all three!</p>
        <p>To everyone who solved their first challenge, stayed up chasing one more flag, or just showed up to see what a CTF is like: we hope you had fun and learned something along the way. See y'all at CDCTF 2027!</p>
    </div>
